  "source_pdf": "downloads/nezhas-shape-town-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7cf7d2d8cffd54401f16135f528c771e36dc2c53275875ec62e39c04c60d05a2",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5b63b04c2b9451a3d90ce935265da710a4cf08876223b6a5ab997bea5ebbc324",
      "text": "哪吒的形状小镇",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e0326e6b4b67f9588178e607d33e3bc0547d41d8440fd619122274c6124810f5",
      "text": "哪吒在地板上\n拼一座纸做的小镇：\n红房子、绿树，\n还有一条长长的黄马路。\n“我的小镇还需要窗户！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47f682cf35de922b634fbfbdaa47a811c43765c7345e273d2fef96f22cc7b5be",
      "text": "每座房子都贴上了方窗户，\n可蓝房子还没有。\n哪吒在纸盒里找呀找。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8792750545ec9cb03bb42647f412ac9cc847193ad3ccdcef8ed5a60326880eb5",
      "text": "方块用完了！\n盒子里只剩两块蓝色三角形，\n形状一样，大小也一样。\n哪吒叹了口气：\n“两个三角形又不是方块。”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a6d0f627c8f616e85d94cbfc3d2acefdeed5ef9c4874cb1bbcb19945cb50848",
      "text": "悟空把两块三角形顶在头上，\n尖角朝上：\n“看！我的三角帽\n有两个尖尖角！”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "889567170b88bfa0d3d37a3b677c8c1a9e9a6e81ed03bd93d174d3b0b9ae13ce",
      "text": "玉兔笑了：\n“我们把它们转一转，\n试试看。”\n她把一块三角形转了个方向。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a857b34743d1a03becc7d398bd0a4d23fa013834cf9111557f6173fc39cff05",
      "text": "“把三角形转一转，\n长长的那条边就对上了。”\n玉兔把它们推到一起。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ce95f297d267c876f72de79631314e94ee321bab14ba3c6e96a1f6caadef13d2",
      "text": "四个角，四条边，\n每条边都一样长。\n哪吒大喊：“是方块！”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c1f149bb4214b932bcad8ad60e0e18a2b853e1192408ade81cdf8dd7e4b134b",
      "text": "哪吒把方块\n举到蓝房子的墙上比一比，\n大小正合适！\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f84d4ea8a9651253567b5bc809f94edfd228ce32c7ae1df405b3b87e1dc17c67",
      "text": "悟空说：“等等，让我试试！”\n他换个方向转一转，\n这回是短边贴在一起。\n“变成一个大三角形！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "23c5fe0e24ad1bcb80ca5f323dd9cca69c18ade2f64ab28a270cfa815b45de7e",
      "text": "哪吒把大三角形\n放到一座房子顶上：\n“像一个尖尖的屋顶！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d81a87a3ce460201f607ed8be54ddb6816bc1c824520b17ca071bf80f73e4f80",
      "text": "玉兔数一数角：\n方块有四个角，\n大三角形有三个角。\n“还是那两块，\n却拼出不一样的形状！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5539d35d8dd2ec554c42e7b4afea64e31ad67762951dce244779b232ad86364",
      "text": "可是蓝房子\n还缺一扇窗户呢。\n他们把两块三角形转回来，\n又拼成一个方块。\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "809b6389a4d5401dbe6043bf46d069773fc27a7efaa37dd5222d79a100019d55",
      "text": "哪吒把方窗户\n贴到蓝房子上。\n每座房子都有窗户了，\n小镇完成啦！\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "851569213bcacc6b769c4b046205eaff5cb5fd44042a1574dc9a2b480680b094",
      "text": "小玩偶们\n走在黄马路上，\n探头看看新窗户。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8bd9db37e60f3a0fa14258fc358683cb0579a8d2b868e6cf74b60d388c57820e",
      "text": "悟空摸摸自己的头：\n“咦！我的三角帽\n变成窗户啦！”\n大家都哈哈大笑。\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
